  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-SPACE II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EUs program f&#xf6;r utveckling av lokala f&#xf6;rvaltningar (EU-SPACE), fas 2, 2013-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU-SPACE 2 st&#xf6;djer genomf&#xf6;randet av det nationella                    decentraliseringsprogrammet genom 2 omr&#xe5;den. 1: Policyutveckling med  fokus p&#xe5; demokratisk ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande, och 2: st&#xe4;rkande av           sub-nationella f&#xf6;rsamlingar. Dessutom kommer projektet att bidra till den interna samordningen mellan EU-partners verksamma inom sektorn    (Sverige, Tyskland, EU-delegationen)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU-SPACE 2 supports the implementation of the National Program for    Sub-National Democratic Development through 2 support areas. 1:       Policy Development with a focus on democratic accountability, and 2:  strengthening of sub-national councils. In addition, the project      assist internal coordination among the EU partners in the sector and  contributing to the SPACE 2 (Sweden, Germany, EU-delegation)</narrative>
  </description>
